==' and instead saw '!='.","'Stack' is defined but never used.","react-hooks/exhaustive-deps","React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'messagesList'. Either include it or remove the dependency array. You can also do a functional update 'setMessagesList(m => ...)' if you only need 'messagesList' in the 'setMessagesList' call.","ArrayExpression",["603"],"React Hook useCallback has an unnecessary dependency: 'message'. Either exclude it or remove the dependency array.",["604"],"import/no-anonymous-default-export","Assign array to a variable before exporting as module default","ExportDefaultDeclaration","'Badge' is defined but never used.","'IconButton' is defined but never used.","'useState' is defined but never used.","'ShoppingCartIcon' is defined but never used.","Assign object to a variable before exporting as module default","'TabPanel' is defined but never used.","'Member' is defined but never used.","React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'setFinishedOrders', 'setPausedOrders', and 'setProcessOrders'. Either include them or remove the dependency array.",["605"],"jsx-a11y/alt-text","img elements must have an alt prop, either with meaningful text, or an empty string for decorative images.","JSXOpeningElement","React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'setTargetBoArticles'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["606"],"'verifiedMemberData' is defined but never used.","'CommunityChats' is defined but never used.","'Chat' is defined but never used.","'Button' is defined but never used.","'toggleChat' is assigned a value but never used.","React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'setBestBrands' and 'setTopBrands'. Either include them or remove the dependency array.",["607"],"'Container' is defined but never used.","'styled' is defined but never used.","'alpha' is defined but never used.","'createRoot' is defined but never used.","'dt' is assigned a value but never used.","jsx-a11y/img-redundant-alt","Redundant alt attribute. S